Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Tags|
		|testray.main.component.name|Tags|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	Then Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname1|

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Cannot Merge Single Tag View Warning
Priority: 4
	Given Tag goto Merge
		|mergeMethod|menuItem|
		|tagName|tagname1|
	When Tag merge Single Tag Warning

Scenario: Delete Multiple Tags From Toolbar
Priority: 4
	Given Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	When Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname3|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname3|
	And PortletEntry delete Via Toolbar
		|rowEntries|tagname1,tagname2,tagname3|
	And Alert view Success Message
	Then Portlet view Empty Message
		|message|There are no tags.|

Scenario: Delete Tag From Menu
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	And PortletEntry delete Via Menu Item
		|rowEntry|tagname1|
	And Alert view Success Message
	Then Portlet view Empty Message
		|message|There are no tags.|

Scenario: Delete Tag From Toolbar
Priority: 4
	Given Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	When PortletEntry delete Via Toolbar
		|rowEntries|tagname1|
	And Alert view Success Message
	Then Portlet view Empty Message
		|message|There are no tags.|

Scenario: Edit Tag And Cancel
Priority: 4
	Given Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	When LexiconEntry goto Entry Menu Item
		|menuItem|Edit|
		|rowEntry|tagname1|
	And PortletEntry input Name
		|name|tagname2|
	And Button click Cancel
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname2'

Scenario: Edit Tag And Save
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	And LexiconEntry goto Entry Menu Item
		|menuItem|Edit|
		|rowEntry|tagname1|
	And PortletEntry input Name
		|name|tagname2|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname1'

Scenario: Merge Multiple Tags
Priority: 4
	Given Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	When Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname3|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname3|
	And LexiconEntry select Entry
		|rowEntry|tagname1|
	And LexiconEntry select Entry
		|rowEntry|tagname2|
	And LexiconEntry select Entry
		|rowEntry|tagname3|
	And Tag goto Merge
	And Tag merge Tags
		|mergedTag|tagname1|
		|tagNameList|tagname1,tagname2,tagname3|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	And AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname2'
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname3'

Scenario: Merge Tags Select Additional Tag
Priority: 3
	Given Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	When Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname2|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname3|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname3|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname4|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname4|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname5|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname5|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname6|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname6|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tagname7|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname7|
	And Pagination change Pagination
		|itemsPerPage|5|
	And Pagination view Results
		|results|Showing 1 to 5 of 7 entries.|
	And LexiconEntry select Entry
		|rowEntry|tagname1|
	And LexiconEntry select Entry
		|rowEntry|tagname2|
	And LexiconEntry select Entry
		|rowEntry|tagname3|
	And Tag goto Merge
	And Tag merge Tags Select Additional Tags
		|tagName|tagname7|
	And Tag merge Tags
		|mergedTag|tagname1|
		|tagNameList|tagname1,tagname2,tagname3,tagname7|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname1|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname4|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname5|
	And Tag view CP
		|tagName|tagname6|
	And AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname2'
	And AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname3'
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'tagname7'

Scenario: Toggle Display Styles
Priority: 4
	Given Portlet change Display Style
		|displayStyle|icon|
	When AssertTextEquals the value 'tagname1' at locator 'Card#GENERIC_LARGE_TEXT'
	And Portlet change Display Style
		|displayStyle|descriptive|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'tagname1' at locator 'ContentRow#ENTRY_CONTENT_DESCRIPTIVE_TITLE'
	And Portlet change Display Style
		|displayStyle|list|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'tagname1' at locator 'ContentRow#ENTRY_CONTENT_LIST_COLUMN'
		|key_columnNumber|2|